          <zone fixed-size='392' forceUpdate='true' h='30383' id='105' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='98730' x='635' y='35367'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Semibold' underline='true'>Vendor Quality</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Semibold'>(1) Image Coverage: Image Count / Menu Item Count</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Semibold'>(2) Description Coverage: Description Count / Menu Item Count</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Semibold'>(3) Vendor Grade - Estimation of GMV for Sales prioritization only, should not be used for any Commercial purposes. It only has value when Lead source is coming from Global Data Science team</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Semibold'>(Lead Source: Automated LeadGen)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Semibold'>(4) GMV Class - Actual GMV performance once Vendor is active - to be used for Commercial purposes</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Semibold' underline='true'>Vendor Coverage</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Semibold'>(1) Catering Vendor Geographical Coverage (Country): Delivery hubs for catering vendors in Country / Total delivery hubs in Country</run>
